  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The intended audience is individuals who hold or are exposed to anti-Latino/Hispanic stereotypes, particularly those who may harbor prejudice or hostility toward immigrants based on ethnicity or nationality. The meme targets this community by using derogatory language ('dirty immigrant scum') to dehumanize and vilify Latino/Hispanic immigrants, leveraging the visual of a happy family to contrast with the hateful text. The audience is likely to be those who resonate with or are influenced by immigration status assumptions, disease/uncleanliness associations, and large family size mockery — all of which are embedded in the meme’s intent and visual context.",
